    "summary": "@a41fff7b9 + fix commit. Scheduler as before (pacing on actual starts across the worker link, bounded retry back-off, re-arm on an incomplete graph, dispose on both stop paths). Fix: admit() and the retry re-arm re-check dispose/stopping after awaiting the graph's state, so a request in flight when dispose runs (or the queue stops) queues no job and arms no timer -- pinned in the dispose test with a scheduler whose graph read resolves after dispose (removing the guard fails it). Scope: the session-source-inventory fixture now refreshes only the pinned files this Story edits (src/daemon/index.ts, indexing-worker.ts, summary-link.ts, entities.ts, codec.ts, store.ts, relations.ts, repos.ts, indexer/index.ts); the cross-file-resolver entry the first commit refreshed is restored. The relations.ts entry's digest is whole-file and so also reflects ISSUE-0f3376a0's earlier edits there.",
